1
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,300
What are you doing?

2
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,160
Getting there faster.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,410
No, we have to stop.

4
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,480
There's a wall.

5
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,430
Don't even think about it.

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,020
Stay cool and you'll be fine.

7
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:19,370
Hold tight.

8
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,190
Talk to me, Lambert.

9
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:56,000
I've got a bloodbath here.

10
00:00:56,090 --> 00:00:58,920
You promised me no body count
on this one, Sam.

11
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:00,960
We need to meet.
Pronto.

12
00:01:01,390 --> 00:01:03,010
Drop point, Charlie.
Tomorrow night.

13
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:04,080
Usual time.

14
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:05,960
Got it?
Oh yeah.

15
00:01:06,770 --> 00:01:07,770
I got it.
